# The profile says the OLT queries every 60 s (membership 2 x 60 + 10 = 130 s)
# but the OLT really queries every 150 s, so the host reports every 150 s and
# the profile alone would drop the group between reports. The first membership
# lapses once at 130 s, because nothing yet says the interval is longer; from
# the second report on the group is held for 2 x 150 + 10 = 310 s and stays
# through the reports at 300 and 450. When the host stops after 450, the row
# goes 310 s later, at 760.
0 policy
snooping=1
igmp_function=0
immediate_leave=0
robustness=2
query_interval=60
query_max_response=10
end
0 tick
1 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
131 tick
151 v2join 1 0 192.168.1.10 239.1.1.1
290 tick
